#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_471.rst:34
msgid "Database Connection Property Casting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_471.rst:36
msgid ""
"``BaseConnection`` now casts string values coming from ``.env`` overrides"
" to match the declared type of each connection property. This affects "
"properties that are ``null`` in the config array and then set via "
"``.env`` - such as SQLite3's ``synchronous`` or ``busyTimeout`` - which "
"previously arrived as strings and were stored without conversion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_471.rst:42
msgid ""
